   "Table printed sideways on the page; read rotated. Column headings printed vertically.",
   "The second column has no printed heading; every district row has a dash '—' in it (transcribed as printed).",
   "Row 'Manchuria', col 'Total Chinese Employed Force': reads '89' followed by a broken final digit (3 or 5?); cell left blank.",
   "Row 'Shansi', col 'Foreign Physicians per 1,000,000 Population': first digit broken (0 or 6?), then '.7'; cell left blank.",
   "Row 'Kwangsi', col 'Mission Primary Students per 1,000 Communicants': figure damaged (looks like '517' but first and last digits uncertain); cell left blank.",
   "Row 'Kiangsu', cols 'Total Chinese Employed Force' and 'Total Communicants': printed with a full stop in the thousands position ('2.860', '29.783'); kept as printed.",
   "Row 'Anhui', col 'Total Chinese Employed Force': final '3' of '623' slightly broken but legible.",
   "Row 'Chihli', col 'Foreign Physicians per 1,000,000 Population': '2.0' with the 0 slightly broken, legible.",
